# Silver City Environment Configuration

Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in your values.
cp .env.example .env.local

========================================
DATABASE
========================================
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

SQLite for local development: "file:./dev.db"
PostgreSQL for production: "postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@HOST:5432/DBNAME"

========================================
NEXTAUTH (Authentication)
========================================
NEXTAUTH_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32

========================================
STRIPE (Payments - TEST MODE)
========================================
Get test keys from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

For webhook setup, run: stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3000/api/webhook

========================================
ADMIN SETTINGS
========================================
ADMIN_EMAILS=amenawas113@gmail.com,00abel13@gmail.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=StrongAdminPassword123!

========================================
SITE URL
========================================
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

========================================
UPLOAD SETTINGS
========================================
UPLOAD_DIR=public/uploads
MAX_FILE_SIZE=10485760 (10MB)

========================================
EMAIL (Optional)
========================================
For order confirmations and contact notifications.
Uses SMTP - configure your provider.

EMAIL_FROM=amenawas113@gmail.com
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-app-password

========================================
GOOGLE AUTH (Optional)
========================================
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=

========================================
GITHUB AUTH (Optional)
========================================
GITHUB_ID=
GITHUB_SECRET=
